  "docs": {
    "description": "Form control that opens a list of options on click. Single-select. Use for ≤10 predictable options — use a Combobox (autocomplete) above that. Sizes: md (default), sm (dense tables, inline filters). States cover default, hover, disabled. Notes: state=active is legacy — migrate to `pressed`; state=error should migrate to feedback.danger conventions. See also: Combobox for search-within-options, Select for native HTML fallback.",
    "figmaIssues": []
  },
  "provenance": {
    "page": "components/overlays",
    "pageId": "2202:1223",
